{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[9],"Id":63,"TextResource":{"Name":"la-pausa","Translations":[{"Text":"La Pausa","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"La Pausa","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":0}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>El descanso necesario antes de un viaje, con una gastronom\u00eda de alta calidad y con preparaciones a la vista en el mismo momento en que realice su pedido, disfrutando de la cocina regional y otras recetas tradicionales en un espacio acogedor.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Get the rest you need before traveling, with high-quality gastronomy and an open kitchen that allows you to view food preparation the minute you place an order, and enjoy regional cuisine and other traditional recipes in a cozy atmosphere.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/063_la-pausa.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/367\/node\/334","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/367\/node\/334","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/063_la-pausa.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/63\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/063_la-pausa.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/63\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","field_name":"field_restaurant_website"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true}